stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Refused: Invalid limit or cursor
    Requested --> Page: Read current live snapshot
    Page --> Requested: Continue with next UUID pair
    Page --> Finished: No further pairs
    Page --> Requested: Refresh after edit or retirement
    Requested --> Unavailable: Read fails
    Unavailable --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    Finished --> [*]
